# Maintainers

The namesearch repository is maintained by **heavycaffeiner**
(146043537+heavycaffeiner@users.noreply.github.com).

Maintainers review API, dependency, CI, and SCNB format changes. Changes to
SCNB bytes require explicit review and release notes. Until a separate release
team is announced, the maintainer owns release and rollback decisions.

This project is pre-1.0 and has no published release artifacts yet. Issues and
pull requests are welcome from the community; maintainer approval is required
before merging changes that alter public behavior or persistent bytes.
